    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The value of this property indicates whether the device monitors the video subject area for changes, such as lighting changes, substantial movement, and so on.",
      "ko": "이 속성 값은 조명 변경, 큰 이동 등과 같은 비디오 피사체 영역의 변경을 장치가 모니터링하는지를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "756a99ef827f1239f5e5d4d8750d2696fe171eccc5174a5b2920057b6400bc40",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If you enable subject area change monitoring, the capture device object sends an [`subjectAreaDidChangeNotification`](avcapturedevice/subjectareadidchangenotification.md) whenever it detects a change to the subject area.",
      "ko": "피사체 영역 변경 모니터링을 활성화하면 캡처 장치 객체가 피사체 영역의 변경을 감지할 때마다 [`subjectAreaDidChangeNotification`](avcapturedevice/subjectareadidchangenotification.md) 알림을 보냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "176a30d51e59433c13558c23263bff80d4895f3548913fa02d567230e8a35d4b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "You can observe this notification and take action such as focusing, adjusting exposure, and so on.",
      "ko": "이 알림을 관찰하고 초점 조정, 노출 조정 등의 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "caa0d8f1318fd981b92d8642fe6212d8bf9cacf4fb3679726c40c914a98e3f0f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Before changing the value of this property, you must call [`lockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/lockforconfiguration().md) to acquire exclusive access to the device’s configuration properties.",
      "ko": "이 속성 값을 변경하기 전에 장치 구성 속성에 독점 액세스 권한을 얻으려면 [`lockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/lockforconfiguration().md) 을(를) 호출해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "41801a6e40bf3239a6f95b68ace2314ba4439f20417cb7c72b2e19b5e2c9b11e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Otherwise, setting the value of this property raises an exception.",
      "ko": "그렇지 않으면 이 속성 값을 설정할 때 예외가 발생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "07c8a70c1fd624718d05b4e76165b247059b50576100aeaa2479d2232ea93b6f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "When you’re finished configuring the device, call [`unlockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/unlockforconfiguration().md) to release the lock and allow other devices to configure the settings.",
      "ko": "장치 구성이 끝나면 [`unlockForConfiguration()`](avcapturedevice/unlockforconfiguration().md) 을(를) 호출해 잠금을 해제하고 다른 장치가 설정을 구성할 수 있도록 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "06c0b845f47d2d6f4e3db438ddea1edc5d5a432a9de5ff62717f5616c9555583",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "The rectangle of interest for an [`AVCaptureMetadataOutput`](avcapturemetadataoutput.md) object is in a coordinate system extending from `{0,0}` in the top-left to `{1,1}` in the bottom-right, relative to the device’s natural orientation.",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
